@@ -196,5 +196,16 @@ python cli.py report eval \
   --out results/onetbb_golden/reports/oneTBB_full.md
 ```

+To compute reference-free grounding and citation metrics from the saved answers,
+run `eval grounding`. The threshold controls the citation rate. Each answer
+still contributes its grounding score when it has retrieved context.
+
+```bash
+python cli.py eval grounding \
+  --answers results/onetbb_golden/answers/onetbb.json \
+  --threshold 0.6 \
+  --output results/onetbb_golden/eval/onetbb-grounding.json
+```
+
 Use `report generate` instead of `report eval` when you also want the questions
 file included in the report generator:
